{"nodes":[{"id":"root","type":"text","text":"# C模式轻量工作台｜一场戏跑一轮\n\n不是先写完再贴十元。每完成一次行为与回应，就更新对象、关系和下一轮条件。","x":-300,"y":-750,"width":900,"height":360,"color":"4"},{"id":"protocol","type":"file","file":"09-给674（我）用的库/漫画理论/韩国漫画大学课程库/01_课程总纲/ABC三模式与C动态运行协议.md","x":-1450,"y":-750,"width":850,"height":320,"color":"4"},{"id":"canon","type":"file","file":"01-十元系统/十元生补克表.md","x":900,"y":-750,"width":850,"height":320,"color":"5"},{"id":"in","type":"group","label":"① 输入","x":-2600,"y":-150,"width":1500,"height":2300,"color":"3"},{"id":"course","type":"text","text":"### 专业课程证据\n现实调查｜制度｜职业｜空间｜分镜｜表演｜产业限制\n\n写明来源，不把学校课程冒充十元定义。","x":-2400,"y":80,"width":1100,"height":420,"color":"3"},{"id":"object","type":"text","text":"### 对象与状态\n对象｜控制者｜可见性｜稀缺度｜权限｜允许／禁止行为｜当前功能","x":-2400,"y":620,"width":1100,"height":400,"color":"3"},{"id":"rel","type":"text","text":"### 场景前关系\n信任｜权力差｜距离｜依赖｜债务｜信息差｜关系定义权","x":-2400,"y":1140,"width":1100,"height":400,"color":"6"},{"id":"trigger","type":"text","text":"### 触发器\n什么具体变化使旧状态不能继续？","x":-2400,"y":1660,"width":1100,"height":300,"color":"6"},{"id":"run","type":"group","label":"② C动态运行","x":-800,"y":-150,"width":2600,"height":2300,"color":"5"},{"id":"endpoints","type":"text","text":"### 当前十元端点\n源端点：\n目标端点：\n候选关系：\n正本状态：已锁定／待确认\n\n没有明确端点，不写生克补。","x":-600,"y":80,"width":1000,"height":520,"color":"5"},{"id":"mechanism","type":"text","text":"### 启动机制\n源端点怎样改变目标端点？\n被改变变量是什么？\n成立阶段、体量、顺序是什么？\n第三因素是什么？","x":600,"y":80,"width":1000,"height":520,"color":"5"},{"id":"action","type":"text","text":"### 行为\n行动者实际做什么？\n行为目的是什么？\n改变了谁的选择权、资源、信息、边界或关系位置？","x":-600,"y":760,"width":1000,"height":470,"color":"6"},{"id":"response","type":"text","text":"### 独立回应\n对方依据自己的欲望、信息和权力怎样回应？\n接受／协商／回避／反制／撤离／牺牲……","x":600,"y":760,"width":1000,"height":470,"color":"6"},{"id":"cost","type":"text","text":"### 结算\n即时收益｜即时／延迟／转移代价\n对象状态变化｜关系七变量变化\n拿掉测试｜反向测试","x":-600,"y":1410,"width":1000,"height":470,"color":"2"},{"id":"next","type":"text","text":"### 下一轮\n新对象状态：\n新关系位置：\n新可用行为：\n下一触发器：\n十元端点是否重分配？","x":600,"y":1410,"width":1000,"height":470,"color":"4"},{"id":"out","type":"group","label":"③ 输出与验证","x":2100,"y":-150,"width":1900,"height":2300,"color":"2"},{"id":"scene","type":"text","text":"### 场景文本／分镜\n把机制转成可见动作、空间、台词、停顿、镜头和声音。","x":2300,"y":80,"width":1500,"height":360,"color":"2"},{"id":"proof","type":"text","text":"### 证据卡\n正例／误判／反例\n课程来源\n正本关系版本\n第三因素排除","x":2300,"y":570,"width":1500,"height":410,"color":"2"},{"id":"check","type":"text","text":"### 防遗忘\n- zx 克 n，不是随便克别的\n- 共现不等于关系\n- 动词不等于十元\n- 对象不天然等于十元\n- 五维是链条结果，不是起手标签","x":2300,"y":1110,"width":1500,"height":520,"color":"1"},{"id":"done","type":"text","text":"### 一轮完成标准\n行为与回应成立\n至少一个变量真实变化\n代价成为下一场条件\n可回到对象与关系重新运行","x":2300,"y":1760,"width":1500,"height":300,"color":"4"}],"edges":[{"id":"1","fromNode":"protocol","fromSide":"right","toNode":"root","toSide":"left","label":"协议"},{"id":"2","fromNode":"root","fromSide":"right","toNode":"canon","toSide":"left","label":"正本"},{"id":"3","fromNode":"course","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"object","toSide":"top"},{"id":"4","fromNode":"object","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"rel","toSide":"top"},{"id":"5","fromNode":"rel","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"trigger","toSide":"top"},{"id":"6","fromNode":"trigger","fromSide":"right","toNode":"endpoints","toSide":"left","label":"进入运行"},{"id":"7","fromNode":"endpoints","fromSide":"right","toNode":"mechanism","toSide":"left","label":"证明关系"},{"id":"8","fromNode":"mechanism","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"action","toSide":"top"},{"id":"9","fromNode":"action","fromSide":"right","toNode":"response","toSide":"left","label":"互动"},{"id":"10","fromNode":"response","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"cost","toSide":"top"},{"id":"11","fromNode":"cost","fromSide":"right","toNode":"next","toSide":"left","label":"重分配"},{"id":"12","fromNode":"next","fromSide":"right","toNode":"scene","toSide":"left","label":"输出"},{"id":"13","fromNode":"scene","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"proof","toSide":"top"},{"id":"14","fromNode":"proof","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"done","toSide":"top"}]}